If the Yao Family tries to chase me again,

285
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,030
I will have more chances of winning.

286
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:49,070
Master,

287
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:50,790
there is an ambush !

288
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,750
This is no small force.

289
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,310
A single person ?

290
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:01,270
You...

291
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,670
Are you Xu Mu ?

292
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:06,710
It is him...

293
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,870
Yao Bingyun's uncle.

294
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,860
There's something

295
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:13,450
strange about him.

296
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:21,950
Your life

297
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:23,800
belongs to me now !

298
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,080
Restrain !

299
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:53,510
A world within a mirror ?

300
00:18:54,520 --> 00:18:55,870
What an ingenious formation !

301
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,310
I refuse to believe it !

302
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:13,430
Master,

303
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,520
this thing

304
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:16,270
is absurdly sturdy !

305
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:18,470
If it can't be broken from the inside,

306
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:21,270
then let the divine retribution break it from the outside.

307
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,270
M...Master,

308
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:26,550
are you going to

309
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,670
breakthrough now ?

310
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,510
Since you have trapped me,

311
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,470
then this tribulation

312
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:34,310
is something you have to face too.

313
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,070
Nirvana Scryer...

314
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:38,990
Come at me !

315
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:45,600
I won't ask the heavens, I'll ask my heart
if I'm willing to defy and to slay an Immortal.

316
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:48,800
I'll draw my sword, and won't come back until the victory is mine.

317
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:51,840
Trapped in a dead end, I can only fight for my life.
I am determined

318
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:54,400
to face my opponent head-on.

319
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:57,200
The more a blade is sharpened,
the more dazzling it becomes.

320
00:19:57,200 --> 00:20:00,400
Please cut through the mountains and rivers that trap my heart.

321
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:08,800
If I wash my sword in the wind and the snow,

322
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:08,800
then even a calamity will lead me to the summit of the clouds.

323
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:13,240
I came from the depths,

324
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,680
I'm used to cold arrows and hidden blades.

325
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,840
I know fate won't grant me salvation.

326
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,400
They treat this mortal world as worthless as grass,

327
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,680
thunder dares to burn the wilderness,

328
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,240
but doesn't dare to bend my spine.

329
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,640
Who isn't born with pride ?

330
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,680
Don't dare to bow to hardships.

331
00:20:23,690 --> 00:20:29,400
All beings bow their heads, only I hold mine up high.

332
00:20:29,410 --> 00:20:34,920
Who do I roar for ?

333
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:34,920
For this vast sky.

334
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:40,440
I don't bow to the heavens, but to my own courage,

335
00:20:38,140 --> 00:20:40,450
to my fiery spirit.

336
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:46,480
Although the mortal world brings countless calamities and hardships,

337
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:46,480
they forge my Daoist spirit to be as steadfast as a mountain.

338
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:52,640
If the world is a crimson-blood wasteland,

339
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:52,650
why did you waste words in this battle ?

340
00:20:52,930 --> 00:20:55,520
This heart has remained unchanged for a thousand years.

341
00:20:55,520 --> 00:21:02,440
If an Immortal is in my way, then I shall slay that Immortal !
